  "explanation": "The Assembly elected on 28 May met in June as a constituent body and did the one thing it was elected to do. It wrote the constitution and promulgated it on 21 August. The one-sided result shows in the text. It sets up a parliamentary republic with a weak presidency, written by a party that had no opposition in the room and did not expect any.",
